  "description": "VAWKEM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H104 Co4 Dy4 F4 N4 O28,C2 H6 O1,C1 H4 O1,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Co5 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co6 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co7 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co8 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.274-3.843 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.77-108.04°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [CoIII4DyIII4(μ-F)4(μ3-OH)4(o-tol)8(mdea)4]·3H2O·EtOH·MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II), I(II).",
